  "term_and_condition": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Terms &amp; Condition For influencers: <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Welcome to the Sotbella Family!<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">As a Sotbella influencer, you are a vital part of our mission to promote eco-friendly, inclusive, and luxuriously affordable fashion. We value authenticity and creativity and look forward to seeing your unique interpretations of our brand. Here are some guidelines to help you create content that aligns with our ethos:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">1. Be Yourself: Authenticity is Key<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Share your genuine experiences and thoughts about Sotbella products.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Let your personality shine through in your content.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2. Inclusivity and Diversity:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Showcase how Sotbella caters to a diverse range of styles, body types, and preferences.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Encourage positive conversations around inclusivity in fashion.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">3. Storytelling:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Tell a story with your content. How do Sotbella products fit into your lifestyle?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Use narratives that resonate with your audience and relate to our brand values.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">4. High-Quality Visuals:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Ensure that your photos and videos are of high quality, clear, and well-lit.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Creatively showcase Sotbella products in a way that complements their luxury appeal.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">5. Engagement:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Engage with your followers by responding to comments and messages.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Encourage discussions about sustainable and inclusive fashion practices.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">6. Honesty and Transparency:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Always disclose the nature of your partnership with Sotbella in your content.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Be honest in your reviews and feedback about our products.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">7. Hashtags and Tagging:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Use relevant hashtags and tag Sotbella&rsquo;s social media accounts in your posts.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* This increases the visibility of your content and aligns with our digital marketing strategies.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">8. Respect Intellectual Property:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Respect copyright and intellectual property laws.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Ensure any additional content (like music or images) used in your posts is licensed or free for commercial use.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">9. Feedback and Improvement:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* We value your feedback on our products and partnership.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">* Feel free to share insights and suggestions for improvement.<o:p></o:p></span></p>",
